  {
   "id": "skatebird-111813@1.0.5",
   "gameId": "skatebird-111813",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.0.5",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2021-10-12T02:40:48.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Here's the full changelist",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "1.0.5",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added first-time popup that highlights important accessibility/control options",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added option toggle that can disable mission time limits",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Replacing the mission music with the longer album mixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Overhauled mission music, so it's back in, and can be turned off, but also plays as part of regular music",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Should no longer show a black screen while the title screen loads (hopefully)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Made forks in Opening Day easier to collect",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The OST now has .FLAC files as well as MP3s.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added option that makes birds always happy (by giving them extra treats, we're not monsters)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added camera angle for hats in create-a-birb",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Birbified dialog no longer attempts to birbify the bold tag itself",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added more backers to credits: I think that's it for the quick patches. Barring anything major popping up, the best step is to throw up a basic roadmap, and get working on the first \"big\" update. Probably petting the bird? Maybe that and one of the remaining it'll-take-longer fixes I want to attempt? Dunno! But that's why I want to think about it and do up a roadmap first.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
